        "excerpt": "PR: Rework Host and HostRegexp matchers [closed; labels kind/bug/fix, size/S, area/rules]\n### What does this PR do?\n\n`HostRegexp` matcher will now look for Canonized Hosts and do some CNAME flattening on request Host.\n`Host` matcher keeps the same contract, but for both the `HostRegexp` matcher and the `Host` matcher the mismatching logs are removed.\n\n### Motivation\n\nHave a proper utilization of the `HostRegexp` matcher.\n\n### More\n\n- [X] Added/updated tests\n- ~[ ] Added/updated documentation~\n\n### Additional Notes\n\nCo-authored-by: Simon Delicata <simon.delicata@traefik.io>",
